                        (will be done by around (2000/11/21 12:00 UTC)

                * 2.2.18 boot-floppies for i386 (Adam di Carlo)

                        (will be done by around (2000/11/22 12:00 UTC)

Note further that r2 is expected to happen fairly soon now (days,

not weeks) [1].

Cheers,

aj

